  "description": "Shared Microsoft Entra (Azure AD) sign-in for ClrKernel's data providers: credential chains for interactive notebook use and for service principals, access-token acquisition, and the scopes for Azure Analysis Services, Fabric / Power BI and Azure SQL. Consumed by ClrKernel.Database.Provider.AnalysisServices and ClrKernel.Database.Provider.Fabric. Kept out of ClrKernel.Database so providers that authenticate another way — SQL Server, Oracle, ODBC, JDBC — don't inherit Azure.Identity.",
